<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will receive a recreation boost that last between 4 hours and 3 days that will raise their recreation bar. They'll also get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days.\n\nThe ritual bonfire will stay lit for at least two quadrums, providing a beauty bonus nearby and counting towards the number of fires around for the Fire: Desired precept. -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes recebem um efeito que aumenta sua barra de recreação por um período de 4 horas a 3 dias. Também recebem entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias.\n\nA fogueira ritual permanecerá acesa por pelo menos dois quadrums, concedendo beleza nas proximidades e contando como um fogo para o preceito Fogo: Desejado.</VME_BonfireOutcome.description>

  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>impacto social de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.label>

  <!-- EN: speaker's social impact -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.labelAbstract>impacto social do orador</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.0.labelAbstract>

  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>número de participantes</VME_BonfireOutcome.comps.1.label>

  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrível</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! Some pathetic little flames drifted around, and they went away too soon (no recreation effect applied). -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} foi terrível! Algumas chaminhas patéticas apareceram e sumiram cedo demais (nenhum efeito de recreação aplicado).</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>

  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Sem brilho</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was lackluster. We were expecting a wondrous conflagration, and instead we got an oversized campfire. At least it was kinda entertaining.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 4 hours. -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} foi sem brilho. Esperávamos um incêndio maravilhoso, mas recebemos uma fogueira de acampamento grande demais. Pelo menos foi um pouco divertido.\n\nA recreação de todos os participantes aumentará por 4 horas.</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>

  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Bom</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. The flames rose and crackled majestically over the settlement, and it lifted all our spirits considerably.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 1 day. -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} foi bom. As chamas se ergueram e crepitaram majestosamente sobre o assentamento, melhorando muito nosso ânimo.\n\nA recreação de todos os participantes aumentará por 1 dia.</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Glorious -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Glorioso</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was glorious! It was super fun and we really connected with each other with the shared experience.\n\nRecreation of all participants will be raised for 3 days. -->
  <VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} foi glorioso! Foi muito divertido, e a experiência compartilhada realmente nos aproximou.\n\nA recreação de todos os participantes aumentará por 3 dias.</VME_BonfireOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>

  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. All participants must be healthy to attend. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes recebem entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias. Todos os participantes precisam estar saudáveis para comparecer.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.description>

  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>impacto social de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>

  <!-- EN: speaker's social impact -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.labelAbstract>impacto social do orador</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.0.labelAbstract>

  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>imponência da sala</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>

  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>número de participantes</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>

  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrível</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The blade was thrust laterally and there was blood and entrails everywhere. Disgusting! -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} foi terrível! A lâmina entrou de lado, e havia sangue e entranhas por toda parte. Repugnante!</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>

  <!-- EN: Boring -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Entediante</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was boring. The speech seemed forced. At the very least we have restored the honor of our colony. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} foi entediante. O discurso pareceu forçado. Pelo menos restauramos a honra da colônia.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>

  <!-- EN: Honorable -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Honroso</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} has restored the honor of our colony. The shadow of defeat no longer clouds our minds. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} restaurou a honra da colônia. A sombra da derrota já não obscurece nossas mentes.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Unforgettable -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Inesquecível</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was unforgettable! Everyone will remember the courage, self-control, and strong resolve. The honor of our colony is now spotless. -->
  <VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} foi inesquecível! Todos se lembrarão da coragem, do autocontrole e da firme determinação. A honra da colônia está imaculada.</VME_CeremonialSuicideRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>

  <!-- EN: Participants will get completely random results, with no regard for ritual quality. -->
  <VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>Os participantes recebem resultados completamente aleatórios, independentemente da qualidade do ritual.</VME_DivineStarsRitualOutcome.description>

