  <!-- EN: If the incantation ritual goes well (positive outcome) it will increase the corruption need of all participants by 20%, as well as provide a mood bonus. -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.description>Se o ritual de encantamento der certo (resultado positivo), aumentará em 20% a necessidade de corrupção de todos os participantes e concederá um bônus de humor.</VME_IncantationOutcome.description>

  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>imponência da sala</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.0.label>

  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>número de participantes</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.1.label>

  <!-- EN: {PAWN_labelShort}'s social impact -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>impacto social de {PAWN_labelShort}</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.label>

  <!-- EN: speaker's social impact -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.labelAbstract>impacto social do orador</VME_IncantationOutcome.comps.2.labelAbstract>

  <!-- EN: Squamous -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Escamoso</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was abnormal! An indescribably hideous gibbering! We'd even describe it as squamous, but we don't even know what that is! An unutterable word! -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} foi anormal! Um balbucio indescritivelmente horrendo! Até diríamos escamoso, mas nem sabemos o que isso significa! Uma palavra impronunciável!</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>

  <!-- EN: Accursed -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Amaldiçoado</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was suitably accursed. A litany of dark morbidities expressed in crime, perversion, and insanity. -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} foi devidamente amaldiçoado. Uma ladainha de morbidezas sombrias expressas em crime, perversão e insanidade.</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>

  <!-- EN: Blasphemous -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Blasfemo</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was blasphemous. A promise of hidden and fathomless worlds of strange life which pulsate in the gulfs beyond the stars and press hideously upon our own globe in unholy dimensions which only the dead and the moonstruck can glimpse. -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} foi blasfemo. Uma promessa de mundos ocultos e insondáveis de vida estranha, que pulsam nos abismos além das estrelas e pressionam horrendamente nosso globo em dimensões profanas que só os mortos e os lunáticos podem vislumbrar.</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Loathsome -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Repulsivo</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was loathsome! We live on a placid island of ignorance in the midst of black seas of infinity, and it was not meant that we should voyage far. -->
  <VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} foi repulsivo! Vivemos numa ilha plácida de ignorância entre mares negros de infinito, e não fomos feitos para viajar tão longe.</VME_IncantationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>

  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes recebem entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>

  <!-- EN: chanter present -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>entoante presente</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>

  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>número de participantes</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>

  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>imponência da sala</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>

  <!-- EN: Uninteresting -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Desinteressante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was incredibly uninteresting. Yeah, yeah, insects are cool. Bah.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} foi incrivelmente desinteressante. Sim, sim, insetos são legais. Bah.\n\nO ritual não afetou a habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>

  <!-- EN: Awkward -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Constrangedor</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was awkward. The speech was repetitive, and it did nothing to convince us of the divinity of our beloved insects.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} foi constrangedor. O discurso foi repetitivo e não nos convenceu da divindade dos nossos amados insetos.\n\nO ritual não afetou a habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>

  <!-- EN: Rousing -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Empolgante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was very rousing. The chanter showed impressing skill and the hymn appropriately extolled the virtues of our way of life.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} foi muito empolgante. O entoante demonstrou habilidade impressionante, e o hino exaltou devidamente as virtudes do nosso modo de vida.\n\nO ritual reiniciou a recarga da habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Entrancing -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Hipnotizante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was entrancing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the hymn, like a myriad insectile legs crawling all over our bodies.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.\n\nThe ritual also made any insectoids that were assaulting the colony flee. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} foi hipnotizante! Ainda ouvimos as palavras hipnotizantes do hino, como uma miríade de pernas de insetos rastejando pelos nossos corpos.\n\nO ritual reiniciou a recarga da habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.\n\nO ritual também fez fugir os insetoides que atacavam a colônia.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>

  <!-- EN: If it goes well, target's ideoligion certainty will be reduced or they will convert. If it goes badly, they will gain certainty in their old beliefs. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>Se der certo, a certeza do alvo em sua ideologia diminuirá ou ele se converterá. Se der errado, ganhará certeza em suas antigas crenças.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.description>

  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>imponência da sala</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.0.label>

