  <!-- EN: convertee's expectations -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.labelAbstract>expectativas de quem será convertido</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.comps.3.labelAbstract>

  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Terrível</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! From the first word, it was a fruitless back-and-forth argument. It dragged on for a cringe-inducingly long time. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} foi terrível! Desde a primeira palavra, foi uma discussão improdutiva que se arrastou por um tempo constrangedoramente longo.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>

  <!-- EN: Ineffective -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Ineficaz</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was ineffective. Most of the arguments were unclear, and the convertee countered those that made sense. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} foi ineficaz. A maioria dos argumentos era confusa, e os que faziam sentido foram refutados por quem deveria ser convertido.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>

  <!-- EN: Effective -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Eficaz</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was effective. The speech not only delivered solid arguments and visibly swayed the convertee's thoughts, but kept the crowd entertained as well. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} foi eficaz. O discurso trouxe argumentos sólidos, influenciou visivelmente a pessoa a ser convertida e ainda manteve a plateia entretida.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>

  <!-- EN: Masterful -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Magistral</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>

  <!-- EN: The {0} was masterful! Old beliefs seemed to dissolve effortlessly and inevitably, and our true knowledge was accepted. -->
  <VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} foi magistral! As antigas crenças pareceram se dissolver sem esforço e inevitavelmente, e nosso conhecimento verdadeiro foi aceito.</VME_LeaderConversionOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>

  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes recebem entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias.</VME_LeadershipChallengeRitualOutcome.description>

